    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c70a1461ea8864ba1195a07b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是，\n在强者如云的特雷森学园中，\n该怎么做才能取得好成绩？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7b1ec2238bcdc792a491fc59a04013a9d8e2beb64649516db771906ed4ed129",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e192ce42cec83598aac9a676",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fababea20ad31267b4738c19",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了将美丽传递给全世界，\n我开始了和她\n为“世界美丽计划”一同奋战的日子──",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbd3b26c6874e970d39901cb629b0279cad95faf666afa3c76bd634a7c92a5f9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bec82e2adaa2225098f9907",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "美丽周日登场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "73d9f5a56609491341501758ec8c0af8ba7b01c74afd5a2f1a923e68b6e49acc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a922699a46863a359617dd57",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "早美丽周日一个世代的成田白仁\n以压倒性的强悍称霸了\n“皋月赏”与“日本德比。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f5b7b24f313102e4c77e819a15a11ac2bae7dc23dcfcaeba82f3c94ab22cdac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e36493ac5412bd41eabbd1d8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "周遭赛马娘们因此逐渐丧失自信，\n但美丽周日仍告诉大家\n“怪物”的存在有多么美丽。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef77852da86329377052bf9d249fdf44ad89356e9d07b336bd1116f2ec3f8aff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4742315ec9e0482d07a66793",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她并非今日才开始宣扬美丽。\n她就像位传教士，随时随地\n致力于推广这世界的闪耀光芒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f02800052194dcc041ffd5d56a7efac91dd20f3901905ed9bfee2f31153e016a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:940cbe0bd65567ece5759930",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了实行自己口中的“世界美丽计划”，\n她的第一个目标就是\n在出道战留下优异成绩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7f39c60998a7932fb61d93a8677daf026b0c022bf39324f4c609b4c3da24294",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:564acc78b5b3f014225cafa9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "美丽计划前夕",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cc6bc93b2cadf0412ade1d03abc3d24c4c28ebc4b181fe869597e7f68900a61",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9189f179513346f321b47888",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "美丽周日到医院回诊时\n邂逅了因伤无法踢足球\n而消沉沮丧的少年。",
      "source_fingerprint": "376dba10eecbaccba26eb62d62f8df5fc5603edae464af479fb25aef9c996338",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87700d7efe0df1e03d6b8938",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她勉励少年，无论是在比赛跑出活跃表现的\n富士奇石，还是边对抗伤势边努力训练\n的自己，两者的努力都具有相同价值。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aef273d2e3f13866266c26c11f5e63beb22a4ca4fe21ae8789212d7642558586",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c031b441fb56f11415a5cf50",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "现在的自己能够改变自己的未来。\n听完美丽周日的勉励，\n少年也下定决心不可就此放弃。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7860f8c54ffc61c459f8c468fa0fffa1127af0994176e6868e0b2afe3ede13cf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3218824fa0b39bab8c759ddb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "美丽周日说起很期待跟富士奇石对决。\n我也再次决定要帮助她实现梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b51a3643da4a7bbc4cf862d3d6d459bedd29bb3d7d5c1218a89d9c0d02e3de0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:788d2da79b50a4bcffdbc402",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所有努力之人的美丽",
      "source_fingerprint": "6dbcae2666c54f4d890b0e94884d73527c84a97764916eb865a1a43ee78d46bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85e403c39b9858a9feefbe60",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abcbb68c9e080df7dd6dd78c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以压倒性的巨星气质与实力大放光彩的\n富士奇石经诊断确认负伤，\n不仅学园内，连粉丝们都因此大受震撼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8217b20f99b8590f6fa8f9a54d214718638a2c5b341b325e4c5b6574b00ec944",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b48b73056bec637763c40af7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45888902068ac8e101bd69da",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跟富士奇石对决\n也是美丽周日的愿望之一。\n眼看这个愿望就要无法实现了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7c31ce045bc9c3884d8930b6754559307ded280b62a15efe0660e3ec3a5193c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a2a30dd3d096324d8cea0f5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec28af8f0f7fe630da3ac98f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但即使如此还是该做好现在能做的事──她至今展现出的美丽思考方式\n督促着我继续向前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55d6ee568344b4142cca04a96a80deab3ade98e36b7e9a83d45433b447c47f1b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
